{'symbol': 'PAYC', 'date': '2023-03-22 07:09:00', 'title': 'CROSS RIVER AND PAY.COM PARTNER TO CREATE ALL-INCLUSIVE PAYMENTS PLATFORM FOR BUSINESSES', 'text': "FORT LEE, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CROSS RIVER BANK (“CROSS RIVER”), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY INFRASTRUCTURE PROVIDER THAT OFFERS EMBEDDED FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW PARTNERSHIP WITH U.K. BASED PAY.COM. THIS PARTNERSHIP WILL ENHANCE AND EXPAND PAY.COM'S AUTOMATED PAYMENT PLATFORM INTO THE U.S. AND DRIVE ADDITIONAL GROWTH OPPORTUNITIES."}